@startuml flux-sante
' Diagramme d'états du badge santé emailing — ÉTAT CIBLE (pas l'existant).
' Le niveau global = pire check (worst-wins). Rendu : plantuml flux-sante.puml
title Badge santé /admin/emails — machine d'états cible (worst-wins)

state "Évaluation des checks" as Eval {
  state "smtpConfigured" as c1
  state "db joignable" as c2
  state "outboxStuck (>5min)" as c3
  state "dlq24h" as c4
  state "pendingNow" as c5
  state "lastDeliveredAt (fraîcheur)" as c6
  state "cron outbox heartbeat" as c7
  state "cron automation/listmonk" as c8
  state "Listmonk joignable" as c9
  state "webhook Stalwart (events 24h)" as c10
}

[*] --> Eval : checkEmailingHealth(now)

state OK <<choice>>
state DEGRADED <<choice>>
state INCIDENT <<choice>>

Eval --> Verdict

state "Verdict (worst-wins)" as Verdict

state "🟢 ok" as L_OK
state "🟡 degraded" as L_DEG
state "🔴 incident" as L_INC

' --- Règles INCIDENT (priorité maximale) ---
Verdict --> L_INC : SMTP manquant
Verdict --> L_INC : DB indisponible
Verdict --> L_INC : DLQ 24h > 10
Verdict --> L_INC : lastDelivered > 72h
Verdict --> L_INC : cron outbox muet (>5min)
Verdict --> L_INC : webhook muet 24h ET envois > 0

' --- Règles DEGRADED (si aucun incident) ---
Verdict --> L_DEG : outbox stuck > 0
Verdict --> L_DEG : DLQ 24h dans [1..10]
Verdict --> L_DEG : pending > 50
Verdict --> L_DEG : lastDelivered dans ]24h..72h]
Verdict --> L_DEG : cron automation/listmonk en retard
Verdict --> L_DEG : Listmonk down/timeout

' --- OK seulement si AUCUN des ci-dessus ---
Verdict --> L_OK : tous checks verts\nET lastDelivered <= 24h\nET crons vivants

L_OK : summary "🟢 Système OK"
L_DEG : summary "🟡 Dégradé"
L_DEG : détail = anomalies join(' · ')
L_INC : summary "🔴 Incident"
L_INC : détail actionnable (nomme le check fautif)

L_OK --> [*]
L_DEG --> [*]
L_INC --> [*]

note right of L_OK
  ANTI-RÉGRESSION (audit F-002) :
  interdit d'atteindre 🟢 si
  lastDelivered = null / > 24h
  ou un cron critique est mort.
end note
@enduml
